      <title>openSUSE education</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>openSUSE</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The openSUSE education project has the goal is to support schools using openSUSE, create and describe additional software-packages for educational projects and create an &amp;#34;add-on&amp;#34; CD for the regular openSUSE distribution.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The talk gives you an overview about the project, where we are now and what has to be done.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </description>
      <persons>
          <person id="2281">Lars Vogdt</person>
          <person id="2282">Andrea Florio</person>
      </persons>
